    "rationale": "Ships the closed portable unit: the runtime modules (contract, model, history, projection, cli, architecture, usage-accounting, reconciliation, artifacts/, baseline/, plans/, git-observation/, source-edit/) plus the portable qa harness (helpers, inactivity-baseline, store-boundary). Runtime modules and the portable qa harness import nothing outside this tree. Excludes test/ and qa/native-identity.mjs because they are Buddy-side contract proof bound to dashboard dev files (dashboard/test/command-fixture.mjs, dashboard/test/queue-fixture.mjs, dashboard/test/producer-workload.mjs, dashboard/producers.mjs) that no family manifest distributes, so they cannot run in siblings; ports author their own adapter tests against the vendored runtime, and the fixtures stay with their tests. Excludes qa/fault-hooks because deliberate fault-injection hooks must never distribute to sibling packages. Excludes generated __pycache__ bytecode caches (git-ignored). Siblings receive this tree byte-identically at T21-T25 via --write --family project."
  }
